    {
      "name": "Real Data",
      "description": "Same endpoints and field structure as Demo Data. Replace placeholder values with real business data before sending.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Order Details",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"oid\": 0,\n  \"company_name\": \"\",\n  \"consignee_name\": \"\",\n  \"consignee_phone\": \"\",\n  \"governorate\": \"\",\n  \"products\": [\n    {\n      \"product_name\": \"\",\n      \"quantity\": 1,\n      \"returned_quantity\": 0\n    }\n  ],\n  \"shipping_fees\": 0.0,\n  \"settlement_amount\": 0.0,\n  \"cod_collected\": 0.0,\n  \"courier\": \"\",\n  \"order_type\": \"\",\n  \"order_status\": \"\",\n  \"batch_status\": \"\",\n  \"batch_number\": \"\",\n  \"courier_expense\": 0.0,\n  \"status_dates\": {\n    \"created\": \"\",\n    \"picked_up\": \"\",\n    \"delivered\": \"\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/integration/order-details",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "integration", "order-details"]
            },
            "description": "Production-ready Order Details request.\n\n**Required:** `oid`\n\n**Matching:** products matched by `product_name` against Odoo `product.product` name or default_code.\n\n**Upsert:** same `oid` updates the existing record (no duplicates).\n\nReplace empty / zero placeholders with real values. Dates use ISO-8601 (e.g. `2026-09-06T11:50:00`)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Batch Closing",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"batch_id\": 0,\n  \"courier_name\": \"\",\n  \"courier_batch_number\": \"\",\n  \"status\": \"\",\n  \"start_date\": \"\",\n  \"end_date\": \"\",\n  \"ended_by\": \"\",\n  \"order_summary\": {\n    \"total_orders\": 0,\n    \"delivered_collected\": 0,\n    \"to_be_reshipped\": 0,\n    \"amount_to_be_collected\": 0.0\n  },\n  \"financial\": {\n    \"base_commission\": 0.0,\n    \"additional\": 0.0,\n    \"bonus\": 0.0,\n    \"net_due\": 0.0,\n    \"total_received\": 0.0\n  },\n  \"transactions\": [\n    {\n      \"amount\": 0.0,\n      \"method\": \"\",\n      \"image\": null\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/integration/batch-closing",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "integration", "batch-closing"]
            },
            "description": "Production-ready Batch Closing request.\n\n**Required:** `batch_id`\n\n**Upsert:** same `batch_id` updates the existing record (no duplicates).\n\n`image` accepts `null` or a base64 string (optional data-URI prefix).\n\nReplace empty / zero placeholders with real values. Dates use ISO-8601."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Fee Request",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"request_id\": \"\",\n  \"oids\": [],\n  \"requested_amount\": 0.0,\n  \"request_date\": \"\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/integration/fee-request",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "integration", "fee-request"]
            },
            "description": "Production-ready Fee Request request.\n\n**Required:** `request_id`, `oids` (at least one order).\n\n**oids items:** either a plain OID (e.g. `900001`) or a full Order Details object (same body as `/order-details`). A plain OID that does not exist is created with status `delivered`; an object creates/updates the order with its full data.\n\n**Rules:** orders must be delivered or returned, must not belong to another fee request, and a paid fee request cannot be updated. If the request fails, no orders are created.\n\n**Upsert:** same `request_id` updates the existing record and replaces its orders. The fee request is set to `Requested`.\n\n`request_date` is optional (ISO-8601); defaults to now."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
